  (text "LM2596S-5 is the fixed 5 V part: FB ties straight to the output, no divider." (at 25.4 115.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "06104491-b5cb-5da6-a0a8-40f2b1f7d8d2"))
  (text "C1 35 V on a 12 V rail and C3 16 V on a 5 V rail - both keep more than the" (at 25.4 120.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f6136254-8f3a-5c65-8c4c-eb33138cc5c3"))
  (text "1.5x headroom the gate asks for over their working voltage." (at 25.4 125.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c6bd5006-0c07-520f-a75b-81139d4c75a0"))
  (text "L1 33 uH / 3 A saturation: ripple is about 0.6 A pk-pk at 2 A out, so the" (at 25.4 130.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b5d65d07-4e29-5053-bf5f-4ffd90538f06"))
  (text "peak stays under the rating." (at 25.4 135.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3a2662d1-fadf-57a0-9e2d-79d529edd706"))
  (text "D1 catches the inductor current. SS34 is 3 A / 40 V, above both the 2 A load" (at 25.4 140.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fdad6cc5-5061-579f-b34c-eee41c5c697c"))
  (text "and the 12 V input." (at 25.4 145.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "082b3bd6-69d2-537a-96f8-5947cb68d514"))
  (text "Power copper is 1.0 mm, good for 2.7 A at a 10 C rise (IPC-2221)." (at 25.4 150.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "71dd6b6c-c49d-522a-84a3-b863d3880af8"))
  (text "Input row above, output row below: SW and FB then run down the board in" (at 25.4 155.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d87c8393-8828-52c6-ae50-aeafad1a704f"))
  (text "parallel channels instead of having to cross each other." (at 25.4 160.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f166b75b-640f-56fb-94ac-2675094660a2"))
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
